OL,3,ADrumcree parade ban was in 'best
OL,4,Ainterests of peace', says Bryant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland secretary of state
OL,7,Fhas said his decision to ban the
OL,8,Fcontentious Orange Order Drumcree
OL,9,Fparade "was in the best interests of
OL,10,Fpeace".
OL,12,FThe decision on Friday came after
OL,13,Fagreement couldn't be reached between
OL,14,Fthe Portadown District Lodge and the
OL,15,FGarvaghy Road residents over whether
OL,16,Fthe march would be allowed down the
OL,17,Fpredominantly nationalist road.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
