OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADrumcree parade ban was in 'best
OL,4,Ainterests of peace', says Bryant
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Chris Bryant said he received
OL,7,Fadvice from the PSNI chief constable
OL,8,Fthat allowing the procession to go
OL,9,Fahead could lead to serious injury,
OL,10,Fdisorder and wider unrest.
OL,12,FOn Saturday, a legal challenge by
OL,13,FOrangemen against the decision to ban
OL,14,Fthe parade was adjourned until Monday
OL,15,Fafter the judge said it was not an
OL,16,F"emergency" case.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
